              {
                "id": 96002,
                "title": {
                  "zh": "作業三：刪除節點後要如何重新平衡？",
                  "en": "Homework 3: how do we rebalance after a deletion?"
                },
                "posts": [
                  {
                    "id": 960020,
                    "created": "2026-10-05T21:10",
                    "author": {
                      "zh": "陳怡君",
                      "en": "Chen Yi-Chun"
                    },
                    "authorId": 9003,
                    "message": {
                      "zh": "<p>刪除有兩個子節點的節點時，要用前驅還是後繼取代？兩種寫法的旋轉次數會不同嗎？</p>",
                      "en": "<p>When deleting a node with two children, should we replace it with its predecessor or its successor? Does the number of rotations differ?</p>"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "id": 960021,
                    "parent": 960020,
                    "created": "2026-10-05T22:30",
                    "author": {
                      "zh": "林助教",
                      "en": "TA Lin"
                    },
                    "authorId": 9102,
                    "message": {
                      "zh": "<p>兩種都可以，請在報告中說明你的選擇。旋轉次數最多都是 O(log n)。</p>",
                      "en": "<p>Either is fine; explain your choice in the report. Both need at most O(log n) rotations.</p>"
                    },
                    "attachments": [
                      {
                        "name": "avl-delete.pdf",
                        "size": 96256,
                        "mime": "application/pdf"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "id": 960022,
                    "parent": 960021,
                    "created": "2026-10-06T08:45",
                    "author": {
                      "zh": "張家豪",
                      "en": "Chang Chia-Hao"
                    },
                    "authorId": 9004,
                    "unread": true,
                    "message": {
                      "zh": "<p>請問測試資料需要包含重複的鍵值嗎？</p>",
                      "en": "<p>Do the test cases need to include duplicate keys?</p>"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "id": 960023,
                    "parent": 960022,
                    "created": "2026-10-06T09:20",
                    "author": {
                      "zh": "林助教",
                      "en": "TA Lin"
                    },
                    "authorId": 9102,
                    "unread": true,
                    "message": {
                      "zh": "<p>不需要，可以假設鍵值都不重複。</p>",
                      "en": "<p>No, you may assume every key is distinct.</p>"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "id": 960024,
                    "parent": 960023,
                    "created": "2026-10-06T12:05",
                    "author": {
                      "zh": "張家豪",
                      "en": "Chang Chia-Hao"
                    },
                    "authorId": 9004,
